# Allowlist, not denylist: ignore everything, then re-include exactly what ships.
# See packages/makerchip-extension/.vscodeignore for the rationale; in short,
# vsce negations win globally rather than in order, so each `!` must be narrow
# on its own, and LICENSE/CHANGELOG.md are not force-included.
#
# `syntaxes/` and `language-configuration.json` are generated at build time by
# scripts/copy-grammar.mjs (gitignored), which is why they are re-included here
# but absent from git.
**

!out/src/**/*.js
!dist/web/extension.js
!syntaxes/**
!language-configuration.json
!images/icon.png
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
